---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import Prose from '../components/Prose.astro';
import { getEntry } from 'astro:content';
const { data: s } = await getEntry('site', 'default');
---

<BaseLayout title="Support SCA — Shrewsbury Christian Academy">
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="Give"
    title="Support the next generation of SCA students."
    subtitle="Your gift helps us continue offering a Christ-centered education. All donations are tax deductible."
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-prose grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      {[
        { title: 'School Operations', body: 'Cover expenses that tuition and fees alone don\'t reach — everyday classroom essentials and school programs.' },
        { title: 'Scholarships', body: 'Help families in need receive tuition assistance so more children can access a Christian education.' },
        { title: 'Scrip Program', body: 'Fundraise while you shop! Buy gift cards for stores you already use — a portion goes to your student\'s bill and to SCA.' },
        { title: 'Endowment Fund', body: 'Invest in the future growth and development of SCA — its programs, families, faculty, and staff.' },
      ].map((d) => (
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-navy-100 shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl text-navy-700">{d.title}</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink/80 leading-relaxed">{d.body}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <div class="container-prose mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3 items-center">
      <a href={`mailto:${s.givingEmail}?subject=Donation%20inquiry`} class="btn-primary">Contact about giving</a>
      <a href={`tel:${s.phone.replace(/[^\d+]/g, '')}`} class="btn-secondary">Call {s.phone}</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section bg-ivory-200">
    <div class="container-prose">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <span class="eyebrow">Planned Giving</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl text-navy-700">Support SCA through your estate plans.</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-ink/80 text-lg">Consult with an estate planning professional who can evaluate your circumstances and create or update a plan appropriate for you. We'd be happy to discuss planned giving options with you.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8">
        <div class="lg:col-span-8">
          <Prose class="!mx-0">
            <h3>Remembering SCA in your will</h3>
            <p>You may name SCA as the beneficiary of a percentage of your estate, of a set dollar amount, or of a particular asset. Your estate receives an estate tax deduction for the full value of your bequest. SCA's principal address: 701 Windy Hill Road, New Freedom, PA 17349.</p>

            <h3>Beneficiary designations</h3>
            <p>Many estate assets are not transferred through your will, including living trusts, qualified retirement plans, life insurance proceeds, and annuities. You may name SCA as a primary or contingent beneficiary of any of these.</p>

            <h3>Qualified retirement plans</h3>
            <p>Naming SCA as a beneficiary of assets remaining in your IRA, Keogh, or other qualified plan after your lifetime may be wise tax planning — estate taxes and income taxes are avoided when a nonprofit is named as beneficiary.</p>

            <h3>Life insurance</h3>
            <p>Designating SCA as a life insurance beneficiary is a simple and often-used way to support SCA and gain tax advantages. You may irrevocably name SCA as owner, or retain ownership and name SCA as beneficiary.</p>

            <h3>Charitable remainder trusts</h3>
            <p>Make a gift to SCA that provides enhanced income for you and/or others for life (or a specified term). Two types: charitable remainder annuity trust (fixed payout) or charitable remainder unitrust (variable payout). Funded with cash, appreciated securities, real estate, collectibles, life insurance policies, or municipal bonds.</p>
          </Prose>
        </div>
        <aside class="lg:col-span-4">
          <div class="sticky top-28 bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-navy-100">
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl text-navy-700">Questions?</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink/80">Contact SCA at <a href={`tel:${s.phone.replace(/[^\d+]/g, '')}`} class="text-navy-700 underline">{s.phone}</a> or <a href={`mailto:${s.givingEmail}`} class="text-navy-700 underline">{s.givingEmail}</a>.</p>
            <div class="mt-5 pt-5 border-t border-navy-100">
              <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-muted">Or contact</p>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink/80">
                Wayne Holle, Financial Associate<br />
                Thrivent Financial<br />
                Office: 410-256-6411<br />
                Cell: 717-586-6576
              </p>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-5 text-xs text-ink-muted">The estate planning process requires the knowledge of a team of professionals including attorneys, tax accountants, and your Thrivent Financial associate.</p>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
